{"sha": "45b1953aa6014991f91553c6e11a2f3c7b20b7ae8f26ce340811b057486b03d3", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[集合代数]\\label{prop:b1:logic:setalgebra}", "设 $A, B, C$ 为 $E$ 的子集：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $A \\cap (B \\cup C) = (A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C)$ 且", "        $A \\cup (B \\cap C) = (A \\cup B) \\cap (A \\cup C)$；", "  \\item 德摩根律：$\\overline{A \\cup B} = \\overline{A} \\cap", "        \\overline{B}$ 且 $\\overline{A \\cap B} = \\overline{A} \\cup", "        \\overline{B}$；", "  \\item $A \\subseteq B \\iff \\overline{B} \\subseteq \\overline{A}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "每个恒等式都是把\\cref{prop:b1:logic:rules}中的规则经由", "对应关系（$\\in A$ 或否定）$\\leftrightarrow$（命题", "真或假）翻译得到。例如 $x \\in \\overline{A \\cup B} \\iff \\lnot(x \\in A \\lor x \\in", "B) \\iff (x \\notin A) \\land (x \\notin B) \\iff x \\in \\overline{A} \\cap", "\\overline{B}$。第 (3) 条是逆否命题。作为第二个示例，", "完整写出第一条分配律的推导：", "\\[", "x \\in A \\cap (B \\cup C)", "\\iff (x \\in A) \\land \\bigl(x \\in B \\lor x \\in C\\bigr)", "\\iff \\bigl(x \\in A \\land x \\in B\\bigr) \\lor", "\\bigl(x \\in A \\land x \\in C\\bigr),", "\\]", "由\\cref{prop:b1:logic:rules}~(6) 的分配律可得，", "末一命题即为 $x \\in (A \\cap B) \\cup (A \\cap C)$。此类集合恒等式", "都可由这一机械的", "翻译过程证明 --- 这正是它们无须死记的原因。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[证明集合相等]\\label{met:b1:logic:doubleinc}", "要证 $A = B$，只需证明两个包含关系：设 $x \\in A$，证明 $x \\in", "B$；再设 $x \\in B$，证明 $x \\in A$。此外，也可以串联", "等价式 $x \\in A \\iff \\dots \\iff x \\in B$，", "前提是每一步都确为等价。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw[thick] (-2.6,-1.9) rectangle (2.6,1.9);", "  \\node[below right] at (-2.6,1.9) {$E$};", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\clip (-2.6,-1.9) rectangle (2.6,1.9);", "    \\fill[omDef!20] (-2.6,-1.9) rectangle (2.6,1.9);", "    \\fill[white] (-0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "    \\fill[white] (0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (-0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "  \\node[omDef] at (-1.35,0.5) {$A$};", "  \\node[omDef] at (1.35,0.5) {$B$};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.6cm]", "    \\draw[thick] (-2.6,-1.9) rectangle (2.6,1.9);", "    \\node[below right] at (-2.6,1.9) {$E$};", "    \\begin{scope}", "      \\clip (-2.6,-1.9) rectangle (2.6,1.9);", "      \\fill[omThm!20] (-2.6,-1.9) rectangle (2.6,1.9);", "      \\begin{scope}", "        \\clip (-0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "        \\fill[white] (0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "      \\end{scope}", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\draw[omThm, thick] (-0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick] (0.7,0) circle (1.1);", "    \\node[omThm] at (-1.35,0.5) {$A$};", "    \\node[omThm] at (1.35,0.5) {$B$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 德摩根律的图示：左图阴影区域为", " $\\overline{A \\cup B} = \\overline A \\cap \\overline B$（两圆之外的", "部分）；右图为 $\\overline{A \\cap B} = \\overline", "A \\cup \\overline B$（除去透镜形重叠部分之外的全部）。", "图示本身并非证明，但它使", "\\cref{prop:b1:logic:setalgebra}中逐元素推演的证明难以记错。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{映射}", "", "\\begin{definition}[映射、像、原像]\\label{def:b1:logic:map}", "称 $f \\colon E \\to F$ 为\\emph{映射}\\index{映射}（或\\emph{函数}），", "若它对每个元素 $x$（取自集合 $E$，该集合称为\\emph{定义域}），", "恰好指定一个元素 $f(x)$，它属于集合 $F$（称为\\emph{陪域}）。对 $A", "\\subseteq E$ 与 $B \\subseteq F$：", "\\[", "f(A) = \\{f(x) : x \\in A\\} \\subseteq F,", "\\qquad", "f^{-1}(B) = \\{x \\in E : f(x) \\in B\\} \\subseteq E", "\\]", "分别称为 $A$ 的\\emph{直像}与 $B$ 的\\emph{原像}", "\\index{原像}。映射 $f \\colon E \\to F$ 与", "$g \\colon F \\to G$ 的\\emph{复合}为 $g \\circ f \\colon E \\to G$，$x \\mapsto", "g(f(x))$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "记号 $f^{-1}(B)$ \\emph{并不}预设逆映射的存在：", "$f^{-1}(B)$ 对每个 $f$ 都有定义。原像的性质比像更好：", "$f^{-1}$ 保持并、交与补运算，而", "$f(A \\cap A') \\subseteq f(A) \\cap f(A')$ 可能是严格包含", "（见\\cref{exo:b1:logic:8}）。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[计算像与原像]\\label{ex:b1:logic:images}", "设 $f \\colon \\R \\to \\R$，$x \\mapsto x^2$。则：", "\\[", "f\\bigl(\\intcc{-1}{2}\\bigr) = \\intcc04, \\qquad", "f^{-1}\\bigl(\\intcc14\\bigr) = \\intcc{-2}{-1} \\cup \\intcc12, \\qquad", "f^{-1}(\\{-1\\}) = \\emptyset .", "\\]", "对第一式：每个 $x \\in \\intcc{-1}2$ 都有 $x^2 \\in \\intcc04$，", "反之，每个 $y \\in \\intcc04$ 都可表示为 $y = (\\sqrt y)^2$，且 $\\sqrt y", "\\in \\intcc02 \\subseteq \\intcc{-1}2$ --- 注意，像", "\\emph{并非} $\\intcc14 = \\{(-1)^2, 2^2\\}$，区间的像", "不能仅由端点决定。对第二式：$1 \\leq x^2 \\leq 4 \\iff", "1 \\leq \\abs x \\leq 2$，这分为两段。第三式", "说明原像可以为空集 --- $f^{-1}(B)$ 总是有意义的，", "无论 $B$ 与像的交集多么小。最后，", "在本例中观察上面注记所提到的严格包含现象：", "取 $A = \\intcc{-1}0$ 与 $A' = \\intcc01$，则 $f(A \\cap A') =", "f(\\{0\\}) = \\{0\\}$，而 $f(A) \\cap f(A') = \\intcc01$。", "\\end{example}", ""]}